	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Gratam tibi meam in extorquendis primum, deinde mittendis <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>d. <persName ref="p1453">Halleri</persName><note type="misc">Nicht <persName ref="p8018">Johannes Haller</persName> (der 1545-47 in <placeName ref="l18">Augsburg</placeName> weilte), sondern <persName>Wolf Haller</persName> aus <placeName ref="l410">Regensburg</placeName>, vgl. WH an HB 25. Sept. 1567 (worin M. Schenck als Brief- und Buchvermittler genannt ist) und: WH an HB, 20. Febr. 1568.</note> literis fuisse diligentiam et facile credo et gau<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>deo eoque magis, quod ea re non minus ipsum d. <persName ref="p1453">Hallerum</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>devinxi mihi, virum optimum, hominem doctissimum, amicum suavissimum, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>qui te facit plurimi et pro suo in me iure onus mitten<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>darum tibi literarum suarum nunc quoque imposuit mihi, quibus te respon<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>dere primo quoque tempore vel eo velim, ut ille mihi fidem studiumque <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>non defuisse in suis curandis intelligat.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Sc<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>ripsit nuper <persName ref="p4554">Rodolphus Collinus</persName> vester mihi, cui cum respondere modo non vacet, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>per mihi gratum feceris, si, quod sine tua molestia fieri velim, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>hominem meis verbis salutaveris et me illi de non missis literis <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>excusaveris, quemdamodum d. ipsi <persName ref="p3988">Wolfio</persName> quoque, quem, cum isthic essem, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>facile sensi mei esse am<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>antissimum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Ex <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> nihil afferri <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>potest non triste.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Sunt, qui praelium commissum dicant <placeName>Condensianis</placeName> prosperum, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>a quibus ipsis ferunt interceptam pecuniam magnam regiam<note type="misc">Dieses Gerücht passt zu Ereignissen Ende 1567/Anfang 1568.</note>; sed haec d[<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>eum] amantium insomnia sunt fortassis.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Quicquid sit, praesagit animus nil <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>boni mihi.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Deus nos clementer respiciat nostri misertus.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Ei sa<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>lutem meam meorumque commendare quęso perge et vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l18">Augustae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>die ipso Matthiae, quo annum complevi 51.<note type="misc">M. Schenck 1517 - 1571: 1568 Feb. 24.</note>, quod faustum mihi sit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p2899">M[atthias] <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>Schenckius</persName> t[otus] t[uus].</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Humanissimo doctissimo<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>que viro <persName ref="p495">Henricho <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Bullingero</persName>, d. atque <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>amico observando.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note>[Von Schrift und vertrautem Ton her ein später Brief Schencks.]</note>
				</p>
			</div>
